<blockquote>
<p>Currently two specimens are in Foundation custody, apparently identical as though from the same package.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I don't like this, and I think the article would be better off if it was removed.</p>
<p>*Specifically the &quot;apparently identical as though from the same package&quot; part.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>However, the victim never recovered from sedation and was taken off life support October 5, 200█.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Wait, what kind of sedative are we using that it will put someone in a permanent coma?</p>
<p>Those aside, I'm not much of a fan of super stretchy underwear that gives people the delusion of superpowers (which leads to them killing themselves in really stupid ways rather than leading them to attempt vigilantism which then leads to stupid deaths.)</p>

