<p>I should've thought about death by vigilantism but alas. A good punchline left to waste.</p>
<p>EDIT: Though, the rate at which the effects manifest make it difficult for the wearer to try and stop, say, a mugging on the street. Maybe. I don't live in NYC or London though. The raised endorphins and &quot;superpower&quot; make them more likely to do something rash or demonstrate their powers than even have an opportunity to try and use their powers for good.</p>
